  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will provide 1,000 children, youth, and adolescents between 6 and 17 years old with a safe and secure place during the time after school. We offer our club members well-oriented activities such as arts, music, sports, recreation, homework help, computer tutoring, and nutritional programs, thereby promoting the health, social, educational, vocational, and character development and the necessary skills to succeed in their lives.</narrative>
